  message: "Audit complete; verdict DEPRECATE — full ADR-0023-shape migration warranted. 4 clusters identified in 210-value taxonomy: inference pathway (canonical seed), resolution status (smuggled in — moves to sibling field), framework conventions (moves to meta), apex/peer overloads (collapse via meta['call_construct']). All 4 leakage tests fire. ADR-0028 draft work tracked at WI-pilit-tokuh-nabij-fonin-sodis-salut-pibop-dirog. Estimated wall-clock effort larger than ADR-0023 Phase 3 (~7-12 days plus bakeoff validation; ~140 production files have evidence_type literals). Both ADR-0027 (Symbol.kind) and ADR-0028 (evidence_type) are independent and could be drafted in parallel."  # 0f36
